{"reviewId": "298451259_89RUW1kW1", "review": {"abstract": "在同一时期，从1966年开始房地产的繁荣呈现加速迹象，日本房地产也出现了很大的泡沫。1955—1989年，日本地价平均上升了54倍，东京等六大城市上升了128倍。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "经济会有大的周期，放长时间，跌的总会上起来。但是普通人的出生时间太重要了，80、90后在风华正茂时成了韭菜。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "21675-21756", "createTime": 1781477949, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "298451259_89RUW1kW1", "userVid": 298451259, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 298451259, "name": "Wonder why🎓", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ZrmzHqE3IEnpOmGMte5uuHp3uxYLiac9dkRlhS2ePqHukMRzk5LOjtXoH8g2AnvxTPI0aS4MgGYX0JEFE5rgiaoL049rYksiavnh2nqbnfsTU4/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Wonder why🎓", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "富有是天赋💰快乐是人权😁", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 74525656, "name": "进击的小徐", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0025-mUGFNR7Cy7oyPjpfi5rNLdc/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "进击的小徐", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "机密", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-2-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读